        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "inference": "Proposed evidential judgment: contracts and governance arrangements could show that the provider retains decision-making, information access, escalation and intervention powers. Whether those powers suffice requires a justified standard; paragraph 10 does not enumerate them as a safe harbour. Register maintenance by another permitted actor does not resolve the provider’s separate ultimate responsibility.",
      "missing_premises": [
        "Actual contracts, delegations, governance arrangements and enforceable powers.",
