      "inference": "Deduction: evidence that supervision occurred answers a different question from whether it was adequate. Proposed assessment evidence includes review scope, competent personnel, findings, escalation, corrective action and coverage over time. UT 6.11C supplies an express supervision standard only for its specified valuation context; transferring it to all tokenisation supervision needs a separate warrant.",
